            <link>https://www.ithome.com/0/984/596.htm</link>
            <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.ithome.com/0/984/596.htm</guid>
            <pubDate></pubDate>
            <updated>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 10:39:42 GMT</updated>
                
                
            <content:encoded>
                <![CDATA[
                    
                    <div class="tougao-user">感谢IT之家网友 <a href="https://m.ithome.com/html/app/open.html?url=ithome%3A%2F%2Fuserpage%3Fid%3D2029428" rel="nofollow">华南吴彦祖</a> 的线索投递！</div>
            <p><a class="s_tag" href="https://www.ithome.com/" target="_blank">IT之家</a> 8 月 1 日消息，贝尔金今日宣布，推出多款<strong>蜘蛛侠限定联名</strong>产品，包含磁吸手机壳、磁吸移动电源、AirTag 全包保护套、自带线充电宝、充电器、扩展坞。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1093" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/a0eb7935-0202-43c0-b39b-bc9e3d945073.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1080" /></p><p>IT之家附联名产品如下：</p><h3>「小魔轴」磁吸手机壳</h3><p>全包裹设计，兼容 MagSafe &amp; Qi2，搭载小支架支持二段折叠，360º 可调。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1093" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/4de00921-bd43-454a-b337-485a45f3b1bc.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1080" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/Ug8qt1q" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/462857/2/14396/58254/6a438695Ff1b72c56/00833203204910bd.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">贝尔金（BELKIN） 支架款-蜘蛛侠 iPhone 17 Pro Max</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price">259.6 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><h3>超薄磁吸移动电源</h3><p>10N 吸力，5000 毫安容量，重 119g，有线输出 15W，磁吸充电 7.5W。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1093" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/a9720687-cd6f-4baa-8bc3-0650b01d666d.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1080" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/UOzxy9R" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/443404/7/5407/73175/6a192471F2e001466/0083320320a59bf4.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">贝尔金（BELKIN）磁吸移动电源 蜘蛛侠</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 239.36 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><h3>AirTag 全包保护套</h3><p>IPX8 等级防水，采用锌合金锁扣，全包耐磨，不干扰信号。（暂未开售）</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1093" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/6e2ad391-c319-443a-9b10-bed80b2f6c23.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1080" /></p><h3>自带线充电宝</h3><p>10,000 毫安容量，20W PD 快充，支持 3 台设备同时补电。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1093" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/4f9ec04b-c280-41e5-bb99-210abb6b3887.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1080" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/UOz5UmL" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/443980/39/4352/457840/6a19a22cFf099bf74/08ee3203203cef36.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">贝尔金（BELKIN）充电宝 20W 蜘蛛侠</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 129 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><h3>充电器</h3><p>45W 功率快充充电器，适配 <a class="s_tag" href="https://iphone.ithome.com/" target="_blank">iPhone</a> &amp; <a class="s_tag" href="https://ipad.ithome.com/" target="_blank">iPad</a>，支持 PD 3.2 PPS 智能功率调节。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1230" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/40fa1840-b149-4384-a90e-314168706e5c.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1032" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/Ug8uWvK" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/439983/21/16683/280070/6a19aec5Fc3f7dc75/08ee3203203786e4.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">贝尔金（BELKIN）充电器 漫威</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 79 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><h3>七合一扩展坞</h3><p>包含 USB-C（100W PD 供电）、HDMI 2.0（4K 60Hz）、2×USB-A 3.2、microSD&amp;SD 卡槽、3.5mm 接口。</p><p style="text-align: center;"><img height="1093" src="https://img.ithome.com/newsuploadfiles/2026/8/77c5986d-eeec-46a4-bf2f-bf854a6c94d1.png?x-bce-process=image/format,f_auto" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="1080" /></p><dir><a contenteditable="false" href="https://u.jd.com/UDz4fFz" target="_blank"><span class="card main-site"><span class="card-logo"><img height="800" src="https://img14.360buyimg.com/pop/jfs/t1/441171/17/12721/318017/6a19559bF3d6ea045/08ee320320c507ef.png" title="贝尔金推出蜘蛛侠限定联名磁吸移动电源、充电器、扩展坞、手机壳等产品" width="800" /></span><span class="card-info"><span class="card-title"><span class="mall-data">京东</span><span class="card-name">贝尔金（BELKIN）七合一扩展坞 漫威版</span></span><span class="card-abstract"></span><span class="card-controls"><span class="price"> 279.84 元</span><span class="card-btn-deep">直达链接</span></span></span></span></a></dir><p class="ad-tips">广告声明：文内含有的对外跳转链接（包括不限于超链接、二维码、口令等形式），用于传递更多信息，节省甄选时间，结果仅供参考，IT之家所有文章均包含本声明。</p>
